  {
   "approach": null,
   "area_id": "bc_slesse_mountain",
   "descent": null,
   "descent_text": "The line ends on the third peak. Go down by one of two ways: cross the west flank of the massif to join the usual descent routes, or drop into the Southeast Spur Couloir between the third and fourth peaks. Depending on the snow, the couloir can be a continuous downclimb on snow or a series of rappels over polished rock with weak anchors. Downclimbing snow is the safer choice when conditions allow.",
